        "sid": "LUK 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu wauya na uwezo mkpwulu wa Roho Mtakatifu kula muho Joridani, na achilongozwa ni Roho hadi weruni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hiko Jesu wakala siku mirongo mine kuno anajezwa ni Shetani. Siku zosi hizo kayarya chitu, badaye wasikira ndzala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shetani achimuamba, “Ichikala kpweli u Mwana wa Mlungu, riambire hiri dziwe rigaluke mkpwahe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.8.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 8:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu achimjibu achiamba, “Yaandikpwa kukala, ‘Mwanadamu kandaishi kpwa chakurya bahi.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Shetani achiphiya naye hadi phatu phokala dzulu, mara mwenga achimuonyesa falume zosi za dunia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu achimuamba, “Uchiniabudu, nindakupha uwezo wa kutawala falume zosi hizi na manono gosi garigo himo, kpwa mana náhewa na naweza kumupha yeyesi nilondaye. Kpwa iyo uchinivoya, vivi vyosi vindakala vyako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.6+LUK.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.6",
              "LUK.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.6.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 6:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu achimuamba, “Yaandikpwa, ‘Mvoye Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlunguo na umuhumikire iye macheye.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Shetani achimuhala hadi mudzi wa Jerusalemu achendamuimisa chirere cha Nyumba ya Kuvoya Mlungu. Achimuamba, “Ichikala u Mwana wa Mlungu, tina ugbwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.91.11+PSA.91.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zaburi 91:11–12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mana yaandikpwa, ‘Mlungu andalagiza malaikawe akurinde sawa-sawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naye andakuunula, ili usedze ukakpwala dziwe.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.6.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 6:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Jesu achimjibu achiamba, “Neno ra Mlungu rinaamba, ‘Usimjeze Bwana Mlunguo.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, Shetani wamala kumjeza Jesu, achiuka achimricha hadi muda wanjina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu wauya Galilaya kuno analongozwa ni uwezo wa Roho Mtakatifu. Habarize zichienea seemu zosi za jirani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi wafundza mo masinagogini mwao, na chila mmwenga achimtogola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu waphiya Nazareti, ambako ndiko korerwa, na Siku ya Kuoya wainjira sinagogini kama vyokala kawaidaye. Achiima ili asome maandiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahewa Chitabu cha nabii Isaya, achichivugula na achisoma phatu phoandikpwa kuhusu Masihi phoamba hivi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu osi amtogola, na achiangalazwa ni manenoge mazuri achigogomba. Chisha achiuzana, “Yuno siye yuya mwana wa Yusufu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye achiaambira, “Namanya mundaniamba msemo huno: ‘Ichikala u mganga dzilagule mwenye!’ Piya mundaniamba, ‘Mbona phano phenu laloni kuhenda mambo dza higo hurigosikira hiko Kaperinaumu?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.4.44"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Johana 4:44",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela nakuambirani kpweli kala nabii kamendzwa phao laloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.17.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Afalume 17:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakuhakikishirani kala, zamani za nabii Elija, Iziraeli kala kuna magungu anji, kuriphokosekana mvula miaka mihahu na nusu na kuchikala na ndzala kali tsi ndzima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.17.8+1KI.17.9+1KI.17.10+1KI.17.11+1KI.17.12+1KI.17.13+1KI.17.14+1KI.17.15+1KI.17.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Afalume 17:8–16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela nabii Elija kayahumwa kpwa yeyesi hiko, ela kpwa gungu yesagala Sareputa, tsi ya Sidoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.5.1+2KI.5.2+2KI.5.3+2KI.5.4+2KI.5.5+2KI.5.6+2KI.5.7+2KI.5.8+2KI.5.9+2KI.5.10+2KI.5.11+2KI.5.12+2KI.5.13+2KI.5.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Afalume 5:1–14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona wakati wa nabii Elisha, Iziraeli kala kuna akongo anji a mahana, ela takuna hata mmwenga yephozwa isiphokala Naamani kula tsi ya Siria.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
