        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu phogomba hivyo, atu osi ariokala mo sinagogini areya sana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi aunuka achimtuluza kondze ya mudzi, aphiya naye hadi mchechemo wa mwango phodzengbwa mudzi wao, ili amsukume ko tsini mavoromokoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela achitsapa na pho kahi-kahi za atu achiphiya vyakpwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu Jesu waphiya Kaperinaumu, mudzi wa Galilaya, na Siku ya Kuoya, wainjira sinagogini achiandza kufundza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.7.28+MAT.7.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 7:28–29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu aangalazwa ni mafundzoge, kpwa kukala kala anafundza na uwezo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mo sinagogini kala muna mutu yekala na pepho, na achikala anakota kululu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anaamba, “Unamini wee, Jesu wa Nazareti? Ukedzahumarigiza? Nakumanya! Uwe u Mutu wa Haki yela kpwa Mlungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Jesu wamdemurira yuya pepho, achimuamba, “Nyamala na utuluke!” Alafu yuya pepho wamʼbwaga yuya mutu pho mbere za atu, chisha achituluka bila ya kumlumiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu osi aangalala na achibisha enye kpwa enye, achiamba, “Ni mafundzo ga viphi gano? Kpwa mana anademurira pepho kpwa uwezo na nguvu nao anatuluka!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habarize zaenea chila phatu seemu hiyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu wauka sinagogini na achiphiya kaya kpwa Simoni. Mtsedza mchetu wa Simoni kala ana homa kali, atu achimuamba Jesu amphoze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, waima phephi naye na achiridemurira rira homa riuke, na richiuka achiphola. Yuya mchetu waunuka na phapho hipho achiandza kuahumikira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dzuwa phokala rinatswa, osi ariokala na akongo a chila aina, amrehera Jesu, naye achiabandikira mikono osi achiaphoza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piya pepho atuluka atu anji, kuno anapiga kululu, anaamba, “Uwe ndiwe Mwana wa Mlungu!” Ela Jesu kala achiademurira, na kala kaaricha akagomba, mana kala anamanya kukala iye ndiye Masihi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ligundzure, Jesu wauka achiphiya phatu kanda achendakala macheye. Atu achikala anamuendza na ariphomuona ajeza kumzuwiya asiariche machiyao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela achiaambira, “Ni lazima piya nikatangaze midzi yanjina habari nono kuhusu ufalume wa Mlungu, mana iyo ndiyo sababu yohenda nihumwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, waenderera kutangaza ujumbe mo masinagogini ko Judea ndzima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
